{"id":680,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，全面落实立德树人根本任务，根据校工会《关于举办中北大学2026年青年教师教学竞赛的通知》精神，我院于2026年5月27日15:00在学院楼301会议室隆重举办了2026年青年教师教学竞赛院赛。学院教学指导委员会成员、资深教授、青年教师代表共同参与评审与观摩。</p><p>按照学校竞赛部署，学院坚持“以赛促教、以赛促学、以赛促建”的宗旨，前期经各系严格选拔，共推荐7名优秀青年教师晋级院赛，其中工业工程系2人、管理系2人、经济系3人。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WozNHiU4GYnR9DUgzfRnl7ioRMRLm-LZnRnVLzlDUmnkUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh2L1yYn1yDLN7an7-ZLNMRLmCiMl-8ozMknmrRMmrfU4AFn7LZLNQRnlWFLmTVLRlJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-4ozCbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=23969&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1F22F62A0DB82CC2655B493BF5C65AC8/DC82FCEB/29E05\" vheight=\"171\" vwidth=\"250\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WozNHiU4GYnR9DUgzfRnl7ioRMRLm-LZnRnVLzlDUmnkUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh2L1yYn1yDLN7an7-ZLNMRLmCiMl-8ozMknmrRMmrfU4AFn7LZLNQRnlWFLmTVLRlJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-4ozCbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=23969&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WolUHiUNr2M7CZMgRAfLRV2MmCPUmTLVMzNanz94nzWkoRl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaLYhfoSh2MRAVUz7PMmA7Ml7DMRvDLRGPMlCiozNYUmrFLNUYozLDoRAFL4G4UNUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-4ozCbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=23969&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/003A9F48EA1168D5A64760015F5992B5/2D293688/303BD\" vheight=\"171\" vwidth=\"288\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WolUHiUNr2M7CZMgRAfLRV2MmCPUmTLVMzNanz94nzWkoRl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaLYhfoSh2MRAVUz7PMmA7Ml7DMRvDLRGPMlCiozNYUmrFLNUYozLDoRAFL4G4UNUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-4ozCbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=23969&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLm-HDn7VkM4VRUg4-ZM49DLmU8nzCLbLz9YLz-ZoRCZUmU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7n1yaUSyiLmrfozUbLR78oRQ7L46fL8UaLz78o7-YnmTFLzNiLRVVMmWFLmTVLRlJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-4ozCbgtA8pUMcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=23969&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CDF0A525A94901486D37A3D01148B2F9/19501E62/29E05\" vheight=\"171\" vwidth=\"250\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLm-HDn7VkM